<line x1='389.4' y1='240' x2='476.6' y2='240' stroke='#3B4A66' stroke-width='1.5' stroke-dasharray='3 3'/><rect x='355.5' y='234' width='33.8' height='12' rx='3' fill='#7AAFFF'/><circle cx='355.5' cy='240' r='3.5' fill='#F5A524' stroke='#0A0F1A' stroke-width='1.5'/><text x='752' y='244' font-size='11' fill='#E6EAF2' text-anchor='end'>$233 · 100%</text><text x='56' y='268' font-size='11' fill='#7F8BA0' text-anchor='end'>W10</text><line x1='439.0' y1='264' x2='519.9' y2='264' stroke='#3B4A66' stroke-width='1.5' stroke-dasharray='3 3'/><rect x='398.9' y='258' width='40.1' height='12' rx='3' fill='#7AAFFF'/><circle cx='398.9' cy='264' r='3.5' fill='#F5A524' stroke='#0A0F1A' stroke-width='1.5'/><text x='752' y='268' font-size='11' fill='#E6EAF2' text-anchor='end'>$246 · 100%</text><text x='56' y='292' font-size='11' fill='#7F8BA0' text-anchor='end'>W11</text><line x1='456.4' y1='288' x2='560.5' y2='288' stroke='#3B4A66' stroke-width='1.5' stroke-dasharray='3 3'/><rect x='439.5' y='282' width='16.9' height='12' rx='3' fill='#7AAFFF'/><circle cx='439.5' cy='288' r='3.5' fill='#F5A524' stroke='#0A0F1A' stroke-width='1.5'/><text x='752' y='292' font-size='11' fill='#E6EAF2' text-anchor='end'>$253 · 100%</text><text x='56' y='316' font-size='11' fill='#7F8BA0' text-anchor='end'>W12</text><line x1='479.2' y1='312' x2='578.2' y2='312' stroke='#3B4A66' stroke-width='1.5' stroke-dasharray='3 3'/><rect x='457.2' y='306' width='22.0' height='12' rx='3' fill='#44608f'/><circle cx='457.2' cy='312' r='3.5' fill='#F5A524' stroke='#0A0F1A' stroke-width='1.5'/><text x='752' y='316' font-size='11' fill='#E6EAF2' text-anchor='end'>$164 · 82%</text><text x='56' y='340' font-size='11' fill='#7F8BA0' text-anchor='end'>W13</text><line x1='496.8' y1='336' x2='600.0' y2='336' stroke='#3B4A66' stroke-width='1.5' stroke-dasharray='3 3'/><rect x='484.1' y='330' width='12.7' height='12' rx='3' fill='#44608f'/><circle cx='484.1' cy='336' r='3.5' fill='#F5A524' stroke='#0A0F1A' stroke-width='1.5'/><text x='752' y='340' font-size='11' fill='#E6EAF2' text-anchor='end'>$268 · 93%</text><text x='56' y='364' font-size='11' fill='#7F8BA0' text-anchor='end'>W14</text><line x1='523.7' y1='360' x2='600.0' y2='360' stroke='#3B4A66' stroke-width='1.5' stroke-dasharray='3 3'/><rect x='501.5' y='354' width='22.2' height='12' rx='3' fill='#7AAFFF'/><circle cx='501.5' cy='360' r='3.5' fill='#F5A524' stroke='#0A0F1A' stroke-width='1.5'/><text x='752' y='364' font-size='11' fill='#E6EAF2' text-anchor='end'>$292 · 100%</text><text x='56' y='388' font-size='11' fill='#7F8BA0' text-anchor='end'>W15</text><line x1='587.0' y1='384' x2='600.0' y2='384' stroke='#3B4A66' stroke-width='1.5' stroke-dasharray='3 3'/><rect x='536.3' y='378' width='50.7' height='12' rx='3' fill='#7AAFFF'/><circle cx='536.3' cy='384' r='3.5' fill='#F5A524' stroke='#0A0F1A' stroke-width='1.5'/><text x='752' y='388' font-size='11' fill='#E6EAF2' text-anchor='end'>$423 · 100%</text><text x='752' y='26' font-size='11' fill='#7F8BA0' text-anchor='end'>API value · gauge at end</text></svg><figcaption style='color:#7F8BA0;font-size:13px;margin-top:8px;line-height:1.5'>Each bar is one weekly window, October 2026 (UTC). The amber dot marks a window that opened before the previous one was scheduled to end; the dashed line shows the time that was still left on that earlier clock. Bright bars reached 95% or more of the weekly gauge.</figcaption></figure>\n<p>Window 1 is partial: our logs start on 1 October with the gauge already at 48%. Window 15 was scheduled to run to 4 November; its dashed line is cut at the edge of the chart.</p>\n<div class='table-wrap' style='overflow-x:auto'><table><thead><tr><th>Window</th><th>Opened (UTC)</th><th>Active</th><th>Gauge</th><th>API value</th><th>Requests</th><th>Opened by</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>W1</td><td>Oct 1 09:36</td><td>23 h</td><td>48% to 100%</td><td>$81</td><td>4,699</td><td>start of data</td></tr><tr><td>W2</td><td>Oct 2 08:49</td><td>12 h</td><td>0% to 14%</td><td>$35</td><td>6,663</td><td>early</td></tr><tr><td>W3</td><td>Oct 2 21:12</td><td>94 h</td><td>0% to 98%</td><td>$182</td><td>28,786</td><td>early</td></tr><tr><td>W4</td><td>Oct 7 05:59</td><td>17 h</td><td>0% to 100%</td><td>$237</td><td>22,906</td><td>early</td></tr><tr><td>W5</td><td>Oct 8 06:30</td><td>65 h</td><td>0% to 100%</td><td>$227</td><td>24,143</td><td>early</td></tr><tr><td>W6</td><td>Oct 11 04:13</td><td>23 h</td><td>0% to 100%</td><td>$224</td><td>25,648</td><td>early</td></tr><tr><td>W7</td><td>Oct 13 06:45</td><td>48 h</td><td>0% to 85%</td><td>$170</td><td>19,569</td><td>early</td></tr><tr><td>W8</td><td>Oct 15 06:13</td><td>62 h</td><td>0% to 83%</td><td>$184</td><td>27,776</td><td>early</td></tr><tr><td>W9</td><td>Oct 17 20:40</td><td>47 h</td><td>0% to 100%</td><td>$233</td><td>19,486</td><td>early</td></tr><tr><td>W10</td><td>Oct 20 08:51</td><td>56 h</td><td>0% to 100%</td><td>$246</td><td>14,719</td><td>early</td></tr><tr><td>W11</td><td>Oct 22 17:12</td><td>24 h</td><td>0% to 100%</td><td>$253</td><td>13,015</td><td>early</td></tr><tr><td>W12</td><td>Oct 23 17:47</td><td>31 h</td><td>0% to 82%</td><td>$164</td><td>5,423</td><td>early</td></tr><tr><td>W13</td><td>Oct 25 07:05</td><td>18 h</td><td>0% to 93%</td><td>$268</td><td>6,810</td><td>early</td></tr><tr><td>W14</td><td>Oct 26 07:17</td><td>31 h</td><td>0% to 100%</td><td>$292</td><td>9,567</td><td>early</td></tr><tr><td>W15</td><td>Oct 28 07:32</td><td>70 h</td><td>0% to 100%</td><td>$423</td><td>39,755</td><td>early</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<h2>What was a window worth?</h2>\n<figure style='margin:28px 0 34px'><svg viewBox='0 0 760 330' width='100%' role='img' aria-labelledby='c2t c2d' style='display:block;max-width:100%;height:auto;font-family:inherit'><title id='c2t'>API-list-price value of each Codex weekly window, October 2026</title><desc id='c2d'>Fifteen bars. Fully used windows were worth between $182 and $423; the average was $258. The plan costs $100 a month.</desc><l